    "one payload referenced by two fixtures: listed twice in the registry, counted once in the digest input",
    "a non-ASCII description (an accented Latin word and CJK text) pins UTF-8 manifest bytes rather than backslash-u escapes",
    "all three surfaces (xdr, rpc, soroban) in one registry"
